{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Alone&quot;</strong> redefines <strong>psychological horro</strong>r in a <strong><i>roguelite</i></strong> format, intertwining two lives marked by tragedy. Uncover Charles\u2019s secrets within his <strong>nightmares</strong> and experience the absolute <strong>silence</strong> of Danny. This title balances desperate defense with <strong>non-linear storytelling</strong> to tackle themes of <strong>mental health and trauma</strong>, grounded in rigorous research for profound realism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/a7b44e25307a1b8789aaacb77c415f9f.poster.avif?t=1769824891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/a7b44e25307a1b8789aaacb77c415f9f.webm?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/a7b44e25307a1b8789aaacb77c415f9f.mp4?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/a5db14748d2d1f2eeac25779c5426975.avif?t=1769824891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras_big/a5db14748d2d1f2eeac25779c5426975.webp?t=1769824891 width=1560 height=230 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alone</strong> features a decision-making system in 2D with a more <strong>classic style</strong>, which directly acts upon the 3D scenario and its ambiance, influencing the <strong>ending of your story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/c549944f7415b266b83dfafdd50431b0.poster.avif?t=1769824891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/c549944f7415b266b83dfafdd50431b0.webm?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/c549944f7415b266b83dfafdd50431b0.mp4?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/1f9d92905b4ca046e6dd18c8ce01619c.avif?t=1769824891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras_big/1f9d92905b4ca046e6dd18c8ce01619c.webp?t=1769824891 width=1560 height=230 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon dying, you return to the beginning of the <strong>nightmare</strong>, but at the same time to a <strong>different moment in the story,</strong> with the opportunity to change your <strong>decisions</strong> to see other possible outcomes. This aims to guarantee a <strong>unique experience</strong> with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/aacf387d0188f61286b3f0b21daa1e13.poster.avif?t=1769824891\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/aacf387d0188f61286b3f0b21daa1e13.webm?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154210/extras/aacf387d0188f61286b3f0b21daa1e13.mp4?t=1769824891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><